  "content": "[vc_row][vc_column][eikra-vc-text-title style=\"style2\" title=\"INFRASTRUCTURE &amp; FACILITIES\"][/eikra-vc-text-title][vc_column_text]\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The department has adequate classrooms and laboratories to support academic activities. Each classroom is equipped with a projector to facilitate effective teaching and learning. All laboratories are well equipped as per VTU norms. The existing facilities available to support the curriculum delivery are summarized in the following table:</p>\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"color: fda101;\">\n<td width=\"9%\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>Sl. No.</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"18%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>Room Number</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"23%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>Room Type</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>Carpet Area in Sq-m</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>AICET Norms in Sq-m</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"9%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>01</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"18%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>M101</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"23%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>CLASSROOM</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>103.09</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>66</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"9%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>02</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"18%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>M102</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"23%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>CLASSROOM</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>108.5</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>66</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"9%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>03</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"18%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>M103</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"23%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>CLASSROOM</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>100.35</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>66</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"9%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>04</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"18%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>M107</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"23%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>CA LAB-1</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>88.25</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>66</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"9%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>05</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"18%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>M108</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"23%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>CA LAB-2</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>67.07</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>66</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"9%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>06</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"18%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>M110</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"23%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>SEMINAR HALL</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>119.56</strong></span></td>\n<td width=\"24%\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>132</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][eikra-vc-text-title style=\"style2\" title=\"LABORATORIES &amp; SEMINAR HALL\"][/eikra-vc-text-title][vc_column_text]<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-25968 size-full\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"906\" height=\"449\">\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-25967 size-full\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"909\" height=\"487\">\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-25968 size-full\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"906\" height=\"449\">\n\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000080;\"><strong>MAJOR EQUIPMENT AND SOFTWARE TOOLS AVAILABLE IN VARIOUS LABORATORIES</strong></span></p>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000080;\"><strong>HARDWARE TOOLS:</strong></span>\n<ul>\n \t<li>Dell Desktops, i3 Processors, 4 GB RAM, 500 GB Hard Disk</li>\n \t<li>HP Desktops, i5 Processors, 4 GB RAM, 1 TB Hard Disk</li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000080;\"><strong>SOFTWARE TOOLS:</strong></span>\n<ul>\n \t<li><strong>System Software:</strong> OS-Windows 10 &amp; Linux</li>\n \t<li><strong>Application Software:</strong> XAMP, JDK &amp; JRE (Version 8), Turbo C (Version) , Microsoft Office Package (Edition 16), Anaconda, Code Blocks, MySql</li>\n</ul>\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]"
